SUMMARY:Prototype test - does your client SEND this?
DESCRIPTION:If your calendar app emails this to the attendee below, the serverless design works. If it only adds the event locally, the mailto fallback is the answer instead.
ORGANIZER;CN=Requester:mailto:requester@example.com
ATTENDEE;CN=Requester;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED;RSVP=FALSE:mailto:requester@example.com
ATTENDEE;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;RSVP=TRUE:mailto:owner@example.com
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR